{"sections":{"collection-products":{"type":"main-collection-products","settings":{"products_per_page":50,"card_size_mobile":"small","card_size":"large","show_layout_toggle":true,"enable_bike_finder":true,"bike_card_title_font_size":26,"bike_card_label_font_size":14,"bike_card_select_font_size":16,"bike_card_button_font_size":16,"bike_card_primary_color":"#a73e10","bike_card_primary_dark":"#ff580d","bike_card_bg_color":"#f9dacc","bike_card_text_color":"#2a2b2a","bike_card_border_color":"#ff580d","enable_filtering":true,"filters_open_lg":true,"stick_on_scroll":true,"show_filter_counts":false,"expand_filters":true,"max_filter_options":15,"enable_sorting":true,"sort_show_featured":false,"sort_show_best":true,"sort_show_alpha":false,"sort_show_price":false,"sort_show_date":true,"sort_first":true,"additional_collection":"universal-products-for-your-bike-other","additional_collection_limit":50}},"icons_with_text_TNEXTP":{"type":"icons-with-text","blocks":{"item_AXN897":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"star","heading":"Look","text":"<p>Your bike should look the way you feel as a rider. Whether you choose the right screen, levers, huggers or footpegs, the bike begins to reflect your own personality the way you like things to look, the pride you take in your machine, and the image you carry on the road. Cleaner lines, a shape that suits your taste, and a stance that matches the way you see yourself as a biker.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","link":""}},"item_xWBrLz":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"star","heading":"Sound","text":"<p>The sound is the essence of your bike — and how it makes you feel when you ride it. The right silencer doesn’t just change the noise; it gives the bike a voice that matches its owners character. That deeper tone, the smoother pulse, the way it settles into a rhythm when you roll off… it all adds to the connection you feel with the machine.<br\/><br\/><\/p>","link":""}},"item_XamBhA":{"type":"item","settings":{"icon":"star","heading":"Perform","text":"<p>Pe